"description": "Cleveland-Cliffs, Inc. is a flat-rolled steel company, which engages in provision of iron ore pellets to the North American steel industry. It focuses on the production of metallic and coke, iron making, steelmaking, rolling and finishing, and downstream tubular components, stamping, and tooling. It operates through the Steelmaking and Other Businesses segments. The company was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Cleveland, OH.",
